<title>SWITZERLAND: Harada prices SFR warrant issue.</title>
<headline>Harada prices SFR warrant issue.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following pricing on Harada Industry's Swiss franc warrant issue, announced on August 22, was issued by the lead manager.</p>
<p>BORROWER - HARADA Industry Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Daiwa Securities Bank (Switzerland)</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Asahi Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	   ISSUE NO AMT 40 million SFR</p>
<p> MATURITY 19.Sep.00   ISS PRICE PAR</p>
<p> EXER PRICE 1,651 yen CURR RATE 91.51 yen/1SFR</p>
<p> EXER FROM 3.Oct.96   EXER TO 12.Sep.00    EXER PREM 2.54 pct</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 19.Sep.96   INT PAY 19.Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 28.Aug.96  SUB DATE</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
